OL,3,GNEWSAPundit and ex-rugby player cleared
OL,4,Aof sex assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA TV pundit and former England rugby
OL,7,Fleague player has been cleared of
OL,8,Fsexually assaulting a woman by putting
OL,9,Fher hand up her skirt in a cricket club
OL,10,Ftoilet.
OL,12,FDanika Priim, 42, had been accused of
OL,13,Freaching up the woman's dress twice and
OL,14,Fgrabbing her underwear at Horsforth
OL,15,FCricket Club in Leeds on 22 July 2022.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, a jury found her not
OL,18,Fguilty of sexual assault after
OL,19,Fdeliberating for about two hours
OL,20,Ffollowing a three-day trial at Leeds
OL,21,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
